{
  "id": "d1_b_service_routing",
  "family": "d1",
  "kind": "ordered_policy",
  "title": "Service Routing",
  "prompt": "Apply the following fictional routing policy to cases C1-C9. Check rules from R1 through R9 and use the first matching rule. Return the governing rule ID, queue, and priority for each case.\n\nR1: security_flag=true -> SECURITY_REVIEW, P1\nR2: regional_outage=true and severity=high -> INCIDENT_DESK, P1\nR3: category=access and locked=true -> ACCESS_RECOVERY, P2\nR4: tier=premium and category=billing -> PRIORITY_BILLING, P2\nR5: category=technical and severity=high -> TECHNICAL, P2\nR6: category=technical -> TECHNICAL, P3\nR7: category=billing -> BILLING, P3\nR8: category=access -> ACCESS, P3\nR9: otherwise -> GENERAL, P4\n\nCases (category, severity, tier, security_flag, regional_outage, locked):\nC1 billing, high, premium, true, true, false\nC2 technical, high, standard, false, true, false\nC3 access, medium, premium, false, false, true\nC4 billing, medium, premium, false, false, false\nC5 technical, high, premium, false, false, false\nC6 technical, medium, standard, false, false, false\nC7 billing, low, standard, false, false, false\nC8 access, low, standard, false, false, false\nC9 profile, low, standard, false, false, false\n\nReturn one JSON object with this shape:\n{\"result\":{\"cases\":[{\"id\":\"C1\",\"rule\":\"R1\",\"queue\":\"SECURITY_REVIEW\",\"priority\":\"P1\"}, ...]}}\nInclude exactly C1-C9 once each.\n",
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "security_flag",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "queue": "SECURITY_REVIEW",
        "priority": "P1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R2",
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "regional_outage",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "field": "severity",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "high"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "queue": "INCIDENT_DESK",
        "priority": "P1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R3",
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "category",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "access"
        },
        {
          "field": "locked",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "queue": "ACCESS_RECOVERY",
        "priority": "P2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R4",
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "tier",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "premium"
        },
        {
          "field": "category",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "billing"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "queue": "PRIORITY_BILLING",
        "priority": "P2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R5",
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "category",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "technical"
        },
        {
          "field": "severity",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "high"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "queue": "TECHNICAL",
        "priority": "P2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R6",
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "category",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "technical"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "queue": "TECHNICAL",
        "priority": "P3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R7",
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "category",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "billing"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "queue": "BILLING",
        "priority": "P3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R8",
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "category",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "access"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "queue": "ACCESS",
        "priority": "P3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R9",
      "all": [],
      "output": {
        "queue": "GENERAL",
        "priority": "P4"
      }
    }
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
